# city-roofs-evening: the city-roofs cameras at 18:30, low sun; NPC and effects hidden.
# Derived from city-roofs.bench with every "set time 12 0" as "set time 18 30"; world cm.
cheat god
clear 1000000
set time 18 30
overlay off
view hide animated morph pfx
cam lift off

# harbour-overhead: ROOF_01 на постройках порта сверху; камера обзора квартала khorinis-survey
cam look -2301.000
goto pos 2400.000 2401.000 -2000.000
cam world 5161.395 -500.000 -144.462322
wait 34
cam hold
wait 6000
set time 18 30
shot harbour-overhead
wait 300

# harbour-huts: ROOF_01 на хижинах бедного квартала с улицы; три четверти хижины B037
